[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5341\u56db\u5173\uff08\u540e\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_wild_a",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loading_intro",
        "key": "$loading_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So, you must be Misha?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've heard a lot about you from Skullshatterer. Now, I finally get to meet you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you also... Infected...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you... join Reunion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "My wife, my child... they were all killed by the Chernobogians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Under Ursus, the Infected were treated worse than lifestock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "The destruction of Chernobog...? No, no. That is far too light of a punishment...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know how much blood is on their hands?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Misha... We've been feared, exploited, humiliated, and persecuted...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Just because of the fact that we're Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not for any other reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "S-sorry, I got a bit heated. Forget what I said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1500_skulsr"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ivan, come help tend to the injured.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're only using this abandoned mine as a temporary base until we can reorganize and regroup.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once the time is right, we'll make our way back to Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Al--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I threw away that name long ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That person already died.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just call me Skullshatterer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you... afraid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Skull...shatterer? ...Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... You'll soon understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "After we learned that you ended up as a refugee in Lungmen, everyone volunteered to go rescue you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've also accepted many new members there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But... you're hurting people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to... do that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are the Infected fighting each other...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "An eye for an eye, as things should be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is a saying in Ursus. 'Welcome your kin as you would welcome the warm spring...'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "'But welcome your enemies...'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "... ... ...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Do you know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... No, you don't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "When they came for me, they dragged me out of my house...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw my mother. She grabbed my hand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw it too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You must have--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "They beat her mercilessly, but she wouldn't let go of me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "She left a trail of blood in the snow as they dragged her away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Reunion had... If the Infected could have... If only--!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they came sooner, none of this would have happened!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "We would not have had to suffer so much!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I wasn't brave enough to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... Aaaahh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Misha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll be fine... It'll all be fine in the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't blame you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back then... who would've been brave enough?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, Reunion has given me that bravery.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Al--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Skullshatterer...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether or not you trust us is up to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if you trust us, whether or not you join us is also up to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you are an Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion... will definitely fight until the bitter end so that the Infected can be free.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But... you destroyed Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Along with countless innocents--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Innocents?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. Who's innocent?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "When Chernobog implemented the quarantine, did any of them speak out against it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "When Ursus sent us to die in the mines and the frozen wastelands, did any of them do anything about it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did any of them ever stand up for us?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Reunion has two leaders who fought for Ursus for a long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "They said that there were some in Ursus who stood against the government for the sake of the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But they weren't in Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chernobog coldly turned a blind eye towards us as we died...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, they laughed as they watched us die!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Chernobog... deserved to be destroyed!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I met other people who were helping the Infected... They...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Despite being Infected, they helped Lungmen and harmed us, didn't they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They slew our comrades and decimated our brethren, didn't they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You couldn't see the truth. But it should be clear to you now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sorry, I let my anger take over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine... I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand how you feel...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must have been suffering so much... all this time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone has been through a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But right now, at least we have hope.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah... She is the one who took charge of the Infected and led the fight against the cruelty of this world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion is the only hope we have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I see... You've all suffered so much...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Reunion can really protect them all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like how Reunion will protect everyone... I will protect you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't let anyone hurt you anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#4",
